How to run:
chmod +x scripts/*.sh
make clean
make =-> this is compilation should produce xdp_prog.o
ip link => to find the network interface of your system. check "2:"
sudo ./scripts/load_xdp.sh -> (use this command whenever you want to start the xdp prog)
ip link show ens33 => to verify if it is attached. 
sudo bpftool map show
sudo bpftool map dump name stats_map -> (this will show the bpf stats map. the map where xdp prog writes to and userspace will read from to give the ml model)
sudo ./scripts/unload_xdp.sh -> (always make sure to unload once done. DONT FORGET TO RUN THIS)

the above commands dont always have to be executed again and again. 
once compiled, to start just do this => sudo ./scripts/load_xdp.sh
once done, to do thus => sudo ./scripts/unload_xdp.sh



